<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National-Oilwell cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National-Oilwell cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robinson Humphrey said it downgraded National-Oilwell Inc to short-term market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating remained unchanged as strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said stock had reached short-term target of $53.</p>
<p>-- National-Oilwell lost 3-1/8 to 50-3/8 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
